{title: Seven Eighths}
{artist: setDING}
{key: D}
{time: 7/8}
{tempo: 168}
# An odd meter counted in eighths; the accents of the beat display and click:
{x_time_grouping: 2+2+3}
{x_sequence: I, V1, C, V2, C, O}

{start_of_intro: label="Intro"}
{comment-drums: Hi-hat only, count 2+2+3}
[D]One two, one two, [G]one two three
{end_of_intro}

{start_of_verse: label="Verse 1"}
{comment-drums: Rim shot on 3, kick on 1}
[D]Seven steps a[G]cross the night
[Bm]no one drops the [A]beat
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: label="Chorus"}
{comment-drums: Ride cymbal, crash on 1}
[G]Two and two and [A]three
[D]that's the way it [Bm]runs for [A]me
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: label="Verse 2"}
{comment-drums: As verse 1, toms from bar 3}
[D]Odd is easy [G]once you know
[Bm]count along and [A]go
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_outro: label="Outro"}
{comment-drums: Ritardando, end on 1}
[G]Two, two, [A]three, [D]end
{end_of_outro}
